00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:41.680
industry groups note the reduction eases cost pressures passed along to consumers through higher

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:47.740
goods prices. Energy analysts point to increase supply and moderating demand as the main drivers.

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:54.380
Policy makers differ on whether the drop signals a broader easing of inflation or a temporary

00:02:54.380 --> 00:03:00.380
fluctuation tied to seasonal factors. How quickly do lower diesel prices reach retail goods?

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:07.320
