00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:24.180
communication as a positive sign while cautioning that recovery remains uncertain.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:29.480
Local authorities continue reviewing beach safety protocols in light of the attack.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:36.340
Both sides agree the injury was severe. What factors determine long-term outcomes after such injuries?

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:43.980
Turning to aviation maintenance, the European Union Aviation Safety Agency directed certain A-380

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:50.060
