00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:14.840
Both sides accept the need for rigorous maintenance on aging wide-body fleets.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:21.580
How are inspection findings shared across global regulators? Now to Australian parliamentary action

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:27.920
on energy policy. One nation's David Farley voted with greens and teal independence to cap fuel

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:33.960
tax credits from miners and farmers. The move drew criticism from industry groups that rely on

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:39.600
the rebates. The Guardian notes that mining and farming organizations argue the credits prevent

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:45.500
