00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:22.960
reports that market participants expect gradual tightening if wage growth continues.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:28.720
Business groups warned that faster hikes could raise borrowing costs for households and firms.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:35.760
Both sides agree current inflation sits near or above target. What indicators does the Bank of Japan

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:41.700
monitor most closely before adjusting rates? Turning to consumer product marketing in Asia,

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:47.620
debt all apologized and removed an advertisement in China that compared relationships to second-hand

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:54.260
service and promoted finding a clean and untouched partner. The company said the intent was to

00:05:54.260 --> 00:06:00.900
