00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:48.580
financial proceedings involving the couple. Tabloid coverage emphasizes the timing relative to Andrews

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:55.220
recent legal history. Both sides accept the existence of the filing. They differ on its potential impact

00:08:55.220 --> 00:09:02.040
